      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so i had my surgery for my gallbladder like 5 days ago and i'm still feeling pretty rough. my stomach is actually getting more painful today and it feels kind of hard/tight when i press on it. i also have a bit of a fever. is this just normal part of healing or should i be worried?",
