      "content": "i'm just kinda scared to go back to the clinic, they already made me wait so long last time. plus i'm exhausted and i don't have a ride right now. my husband says it's probably just inflammation from the incisions and that i should just take some extra ibuprofen and some warm compresses to help it relax. do you think i can just try that for tonight and see if it feels better in the morning?",
