      "content": "i mean i hear you but like... i checked my temp and it's only like 99.4. that's not really a high fever, right? and the pain isn't like 'emergency' pain, it's just a constant dull ache that gets sharper if i move too much. if i just take a couple of strong painkillers and sleep it off, won't that just help me get through the night? i really don't want to go to the ER if i don't have to, it's so expensive and stressful. isn't it possible i'm just overreacting because i'm tired?",
